<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>ระบบยืม-คืนอุปกรณ์ และติดตามงานซ่อม</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sarabun:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary-color: #5B48D9;
      --primary-hover: #4835B9;
      --primary-light: #EEECFB;
      --bg-color: #0F172A;
      --surface-color: #FFFFFF;
      --text-main: #1E293B;
      --text-muted: #64748B;
      --border-color: #E2E8F0;
      --danger-color: #EF4444;
      --success-color: #10B981;
      --warning-color: #F59E0B;
      --radius-sm: 8px;
      --radius-md: 12px;
      --radius-lg: 20px;
      --shadow-sm: 0 2px 8px rgba(91, 72, 217, 0.05);
      --shadow-md: 0 4px 16px rgba(91, 72, 217, 0.08);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Sarabun', sans-serif; }
    
    body { 
      background: #0B0F19; 
      background-image: 
        radial-gradient(at 10% 15%, rgba(91, 72, 217, 0.18) 0px, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(at 90% 85%, rgba(42, 34, 114, 0.25) 0px, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(30, 27, 75, 0.4) 0%, rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.95) 100%);
      background-attachment: fixed;
      color: var(--text-main); 
      display: flex; 
      justify-content: center; 
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px; 
      min-height: 100vh; 
      position: relative; 
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    .bg-ambient-orb {
      position: fixed;
      border-radius: 50%;
      filter: blur(120px);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
      opacity: 0.6;
    }
    .orb-1 {
      width: 450px;
      height: 450px;
      background: #5B48D9;
      top: -100px;
      left: -100px;
      animation: floatOrb1 18s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }
    .orb-2 {
      width: 500px;
      height: 500px;
      background: #2A2272;
      bottom: -150px;
      right: -100px;
      animation: floatOrb2 22s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }
    .orb-focus-spotlight {
      width: 600px;
      height: 600px;
      background: rgba(91, 72, 217, 0.12);
      top: 50%;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      filter: blur(140px);
    }

    @keyframes floatOrb1 {
      0% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
      100% { transform: translate(60px, 80px) scale(1.15); }
    }
    @keyframes floatOrb2 {
      0% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
      100% { transform: translate(-80px, -60px) scale(1.1); }
    }

    .bg-grid-pattern {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
      background-image: 
        linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 40px 40px;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
      mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(0,0,0,0.8) 20%, transparent 80%);
      -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(0,0,0,0.8) 20%, transparent 80%);
    }

    .screen-section { display: none; width: 100%; max-width: 1100px; animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease; position: relative; z-index: 2; }
    .screen-section.active-screen { display: block; }
    @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }

    .login-wrapper { 
      display: flex; 
      width: 100%; 
      max-width: 920px; 
      min-height: 580px; 
      background: var(--surface-color); 
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg); 
      box-shadow: 
        0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),
        0 0 40px rgba(91, 72, 217, 0.2); 
      overflow: hidden; 
      margin: 20px auto; 
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    }
    
    .login-hero { 
      flex: 1; 
      position: relative;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0F172A 0%, #1E1B4B 35%, #2A2272 70%, #5B48D9 100%);
      color: #FFF; 
      padding: 40px; 
      display: flex; 
      flex-direction: column; 
      justify-content: space-between; 
      overflow: hidden;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    #hero-canvas {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
      z-index: 1;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .hero-tech-grid {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
      background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),
                        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 30px 30px;
      z-index: 0;
      mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, black 40%, transparent 80%);
      -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, black 40%, transparent 80%);
    }

    .hero-light-sweep {
      position: absolute;
      top: -50%; left: -50%; width: 200%; height: 200%;
      background: linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 45%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) 50%, transparent 55%);
      animation: sweepAnimation 7s infinite ease-in-out;
      z-index: 2;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    @keyframes sweepAnimation {
      0% { transform: translate(-30%, -30%) rotate(0deg); }
      50% { transform: translate(15%, 15%) rotate(0deg); }
      100% { transform: translate(-30%, -30%) rotate(0deg); }
    }

    .tech-card {
      position: absolute;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.25), inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
      z-index: 2;
      pointer-events: none;
      animation: floatCard 5s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }
    .card-camera { top: 35%; right: 8%; animation-delay: 0s; }
    .card-laptop { top: 54%; left: 6%; animation-delay: -2.5s; }

    @keyframes floatCard {
      0% { transform: translateY(0px) rotate(0deg); }
      100% { transform: translateY(-12px) rotate(3deg); }
    }

    .hero-content-top { z-index: 3; position: relative; }
    .hero-content-bottom { 
      z-index: 3; 
      position: relative; 
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); 
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px); 
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      padding: 18px 20px; 
      border-radius: 16px; 
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    }

    .login-hero .badge { 
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18); 
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px); 
      padding: 6px 16px; 
      border-radius: 20px; 
      font-size: 12px; 
      width: fit-content; 
      display: inline-flex; 
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-weight: 600; 
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(91, 72, 217, 0.5);
    }
    .badge-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; background: #34D399; border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 8px #34D399; }

    .login-hero h1 { 
      font-size: 28px; 
      margin: 18px 0; 
      line-height: 1.35; 
      font-weight: 700;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #E0E7FF 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3));
    }
    .login-hero .credits { font-size: 12px; opacity: 0.95; line-height: 1.7; }

    .login-form-container { flex: 1.1; padding: 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; background: #FFFFFF; }
    .form-group { margin-bottom: 18px; position: relative; }
    .form-group label { display: block; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px; color: var(--text-main); }
    .form-control { width: 100%; padding: 10px 14px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); font-size: 14px; transition: all 0.25s; }
    .form-control:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--primary-color); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(91, 72, 217, 0.15); }
    .form-control.error { border-color: var(--danger-color); }

    .login-actions { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .login-actions label { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; cursor: pointer; }
    .login-actions a { color: var(--primary-color); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }
    .login-actions a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    .btn-primary { width: 100%; padding: 12px; background: var(--primary-color); color: white; border: none; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(91, 72, 217, 0.25); }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--primary-hover); transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(91, 72, 217, 0.35); }
    .btn-primary:disabled { opacity: 0.6; cursor: not-allowed; transform: none; box-shadow: none; }

    .divider { display: flex; align-items: center; text-align: center; margin: 24px 0; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
    .divider::before, .divider::after { content: ''; flex: 1; border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0; }
    .divider span { padding: 0 12px; }

    .social-login { display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: center; }
    .social-btn { flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: white; cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; transition: all 0.2s; }
    .social-btn:hover { background: #F8FAFC; border-color: var(--primary-color); }
    .social-btn svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; }

    .signup-text { text-align: center; margin-top: 24px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); }
    .signup-text a { color: var(--primary-color); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; }

    .app-header { background: var(--surface-color); padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .brand-title-group { min-width: 140px; }
    .brand-subtitle { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 500; }
    .brand-title { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-main); line-height: 1.1; }

    .header-search { flex: 1; max-width: 420px; position: relative; }
    .header-search input { width: 100%; padding: 8px 16px 8px 38px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); font-size: 13px; background: #F8FAFC; transition: all 0.2s; }
    .header-search input:focus { background: #FFF; border-color: var(--primary-color); outline: none; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(91, 72, 217, 0.1); }
    .header-search::before { content: "🔍"; position: absolute; left: 12px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.5; }

    .nav-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
    .nav-btn { padding: 7px 16px; border: 1px solid transparent; background: #F1F5F9; color: var(--text-main); border-radius: 20px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; white-space: nowrap; }
    .nav-btn:hover { background: #E2E8F0; }
    .nav-btn.active { background: var(--primary-color); color: white; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(91, 72, 217, 0.3); }
    .nav-btn.logout { background: #1E1B4B; color: white; }
    .nav-btn.logout:hover { background: #121033; }

    .profile-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; }
    @media (max-width: 820px) { .profile-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .login-wrapper { flex-direction: column; } }

    .card { background: var(--surface-color); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 24px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .card-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #F1F5F9; padding-bottom: 10px; }
    .card-header h3 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-main); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }

    .profile-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px 20px; }
    @media (max-width: 480px) { .profile-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    .profile-item label { display: block; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 2px; }
    .profile-item p { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-main); word-break: break-all; }

    .status-badge { display: inline-block; padding: 2px 10px; background: var(--primary-light); color: var(--primary-color); border-radius: 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
    .status-badge.active { background: #DCFCE7; color: #16A34A; }

    .staff-stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .stat-box { background: #F8FAFC; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 12px 8px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); text-align: center; transition: transform 0.2s; }
    .stat-box:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .stat-box .number { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-color); }
    .stat-box .label { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 2px; }

    .btn-secondary { padding: 6px 12px; background: #F1F5F9; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); font-size: 13px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 500; transition: all 0.2s; }
    .btn-secondary:hover { background: #E2E8F0; }

    .masked-input-group { display: flex; align-items: center; background: #F8FAFC; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 6px 12px; }
    .masked-input-group input { border: none; background: transparent; width: 100%; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-main); outline: none; }
    .eye-icon { cursor: pointer; user-select: none; font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-left: 8px; transition: color 0.2s; }
    .eye-icon:hover { color: var(--primary-color); }

    .activity-log { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
    .log-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 12px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--border-color); }
    .log-row:last-child { border: none; padding-bottom: 0; }
    .log-action { font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-main); }
    .log-time { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }

    .alert-msg { font-size: 13px; margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 6px; display: none; line-height: 1.5; }
    .alert-msg.error { color: var(--danger-color); background: #FEF2F2; display: block; }
    .alert-msg.success { color: var(--success-color); background: #ECFDF5; display: block; }
    .alert-msg.warning { color: var(--warning-color); background: #FFFBEB; display: block; }

    .page-content { display: none; }
    .page-content.active { display: block; }
    .placeholder-panel { padding: 40px; text-align: center; background: white; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); color: var(--text-muted); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); }

    .modal-overlay { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); backdrop-filter: blur(6px); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; z-index: 1000; opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; transition: all 0.25s ease; }
    .modal-overlay.active { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; }
    .modal-card { background: var(--surface-color); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); width: 100%; max-width: 440px; padding: 24px; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); transform: translateY(12px); transition: all 0.25s ease; max-height: 90vh; overflow-y: auto; }
    .modal-overlay.active .modal-card { transform: translateY(0); }
    .modal-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px; padding-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #F1F5F9; }
    .modal-header h3 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-main); }
    .close-btn { background: none; border: none; font-size: 18px; cursor: pointer; color: var(--text-muted); }
    .modal-footer { display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: flex-end; margin-top: 24px; }

    .otp-notification { 
      position: fixed; 
      top: 30px; 
      left: 50%; 
      transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-100px); 
      z-index: 9999; 
      background: #1E1B4B; 
      color: #FFF; 
      padding: 16px 24px; 
      border-radius: var(--radius-md); 
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); 
      border-top: 4px solid var(--primary-color); 
      width: 90%;
      max-width: 360px; 
      opacity: 0; 
      transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275); 
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .otp-notification.show { 
      transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); 
      opacity: 1; 
      pointer-events: auto;
    }
    .otp-notification-title { font-size: 13px; color: #94A3B8; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .otp-notification-body { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; text-align: center; }
    .otp-code-highlight { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #818CF8; letter-spacing: 4px; margin-top: 6px; display: block; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- DYNAMIC AMBIENT LIGHTING BACKGROUND ELEMENTS -->
  <div class="bg-ambient-orb orb-1"></div>
  <div class="bg-ambient-orb orb-2"></div>
  <div class="bg-ambient-orb orb-focus-spotlight"></div>
  <div class="bg-grid-pattern"></div>

  <div id="otp-toast" class="otp-notification">
    <div class="otp-notification-title">
      <span>💬 SMS แจ้งเตือน</span>
      <span>เมื่อครู่นี้</span>
    </div>
    <div class="otp-notification-body">
      รหัส OTP สำหรับยืนยันตัวตนของคุณคือ:
      <span id="toast-otp-code" class="otp-code-highlight">123456</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- LOGIN SCREEN -->
  <div id="login-screen" class="screen-section active-screen">
    <div class="login-wrapper">
      <div class="login-hero" id="hero-container">
        <canvas id="hero-canvas"></canvas>
        <div class="hero-tech-grid"></div>
        <div class="hero-light-sweep"></div>

        <div class="tech-card card-camera">
          <span>📷</span> <span>กล้อง/เลนส์พร้อมใช้งาน</span>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-card card-laptop">
          <span>💻</span> <span>ระบบติดตามงานซ่อม</span>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-content-top">
          <div class="badge"><span class="badge-dot"></span> มหาวิทยาลัยศิลปากร - ระบบงานอุปกรณ์</div>
          <h1>ระบบยืม-คืนอุปกรณ์<br>และติดตามงานซ่อม</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="hero-content-bottom credits">
          <p><strong>ผู้พัฒนา:</strong></p>
          <p>ศิริมา วรนาม 671310031</p>
          <p>สมิตา นาคสุริยะ 671310042</p>
          <p>สิทธพงษ์ สีหามาตย์ 671310474</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="login-form-container">
        <h2 style="margin-bottom: 4px;">เข้าสู่ระบบเจ้าหน้าที่</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 24px;">กรุณาระบุข้อมูลเพื่อเข้าใช้งานระบบบริหารจัดการ</p>
        
        <form id="login-form" onsubmit="handleLogin(event)">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="username">ชื่อผู้ใช้ / รหัสพนักงาน</label>
            <input type="text" id="username" class="form-control" placeholder="กรอกชื่อผู้ใช้หรือรหัสพนักงาน" required autocomplete="username">
          </div>
          
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="login-pass">รหัสผ่าน</label>
            <div class="masked-input-group" style="background: white; padding: 8px 12px;">
              <input type="password" id="login-pass" placeholder="กรอกรหัสผ่าน" required autocomplete="current-password">
              <span class="eye-icon" onclick="toggleVisibility('login-pass', this)">👁️</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div id="login-error" class="alert-msg error"></div>

          <div class="login-actions">
            <label><input type="checkbox" id="remember-me"> จำฉันไว้ในระบบ</label>
            <a onclick="openForgotPasswordModal()">ลืมรหัสผ่าน?</a>
          </div>

          <button type="submit" id="login-btn" class="btn-primary">เข้าสู่ระบบ</button>
        </form>

        <div class="divider"><span>หรือเข้าสู่ระบบด้วย</span></div>

        <div class="social-login">
          <button class="social-btn" onclick="loginWithSocial('Google')">
